| `showcase` | A site that presents the project from its own corpus: features, principles, checks, models and the wiki. | `make run-api` and `make run-web` | [`showcase`](settings.md#copier-questions), [`corpus.served_visibilities`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | A presentation of the repository, not a product feature of yours. A node at a level outside the served levels is absent from every page and route. The node route and the markdown body also ask the level the file states on disk now, so a document reclassified after the corpus was built is not served; the tree and search list the stale corpus until it is rebuilt. | `docs/guides/showcase-site.md` | when showcase |
